<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    the design's versioned interface package: the one assembly a plugin compiles against. Deliberately
    narrower than the internal model, and deliberately dependency-free — a plugin written against
    plain records and interfaces cannot couple itself to MailKit, Avalonia or the store, so those
    can move without breaking anybody. The host resolves this assembly for every plugin from its
    own copy, which is what makes a plugin's IPlugin and ours the same type.

    Licensing, stated here as well as in the documentation: Mailbox is GPL-3.0, so a plugin that
    links this API is itself subject to the GPL when distributed.
  -->

